<https://caselinker.up.railway.app/resource/case/doj_ceos_2013_015/admission/1> a cacontology-undercover:IncriminatingStatement ;
    rdfs:label "sexually abusing another young boy in Athens County several years ago and discussing that abuse with the individual, ..." ;
    dcterms:source <https://www.justice.gov/usao-sdoh/pr/athens-man-sentenced-25-years-prison-producing-child-pornography> ;
    ns1:admissionContext "inson on a criminal complaint on March 16, 2012. He has been in custody since his arrest. Hutchinson also admitted to sexually abusing an..." ;
